message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the preprint below."
title: "actinn-jax-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Benchmark harness, per-method adapters, run configurations, environment
  lockfiles, result tables and figure scripts for a thirteen-method comparison
  of single-cell cell-type annotation methods on commodity hardware.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/iandriver/actinn-jax-benchmark"
